### Get all students
GET http://localhost:5000/students

### Get one student
GET http://localhost:5000/students/6adb4e37d8254ae32fff19b1

### Update a student
PUT http://localhost:5000/students/6adb4e37d8254ae32fff19b1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "age": 23,
  "level": 400
}

### Invalid ID (should return 400)
GET http://localhost:5000/students/123

### Student not found (should return 404)
GET http://localhost:5000/students/64b7f0f2a1b2c3d4e5f60789

### Unknown route (should return 404)
GET http://localhost:5000/anything

### Invalid data (should return 400)
POST http://localhost:5000/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "A",
  "email": "abc",
  "age": 200
}

### Register a student to delete
POST http://localhost:5000/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "Delete",
  "email": "test.delete@example.com",
  "age": 20,
  "gender": "Other",
  "department": "Computer Science",
  "level": 100
}

### Delete the test student (replace PASTE_TEST_ID)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/students/PASTE_TEST_ID